 "rules": [
  "Checks in order: currency == INR (UPI_CURRENCY_NOT_INR), 1 <= amount_minor <= 999999999999 (AMOUNT_NOT_POSITIVE / AMOUNT_TOO_LARGE), UPI ID (UPI_INVALID_VPA).",
  "UPI ID: trimmed, must match ^[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9._-]{1,255}@[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]{1,63}$, handle lower-cased.",
  "pn/tn: whitespace collapsed, characters outside printable ASCII dropped, trimmed; tn cut to 50 characters then right-trimmed; empty tn is left out; empty pn falls back to the UPI ID.",
  "Encoding: every byte except A-Z a-z 0-9 - . _ ~ as %XX (upper case); space is %20.",
  "am: integer paise as plain decimal rupees with 2 decimals; cu is always INR."
 ],
